    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'm not really in a position to go back to the doctor right now, it's just a lot of stress and money and i really don't feel like it's an emergency if i can still walk and talk. if it is just bell's palsy, can i just take some steroids or something at home to get it under control? like, what's the standard way to treat that so i don't have to keep rushing to the hospital?",
